# PLACEHOLDER grammar check (workstream Q): every condition and effect of design/godot-dialogue.md
# once, walked by tools/qa/dialogue_walk.gd. Not story, never shown in the game.

~ start
PLACEHOLDER speaker: PLACEHOLDER line, {{name}}.
if holding spring
	PLACEHOLDER speaker: PLACEHOLDER line: holding.
	set placeholder_saw_holding = true
elif has pogs
	PLACEHOLDER speaker: PLACEHOLDER line: has.
	take pogs
	set placeholder_saw_has = true
else
	PLACEHOLDER speaker: PLACEHOLDER line: neither.
- PLACEHOLDER response: unlock [if not placeholder_never_set /]
	unlock placeholder_gate
	$> placeholder_off = false
	=> END
- PLACEHOLDER response: hidden unless holding [if holding dice /]
	lock placeholder_gate
	=> END
